lis membaja pokok?","p":["Bapa","Datuk","Ibu","Cikgu"],"a":"Datuk","pt":"D","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.200fea","j":"mcq","s":"Bilakah penulis menyiram pokok?","p":["Pada hari minggu sahaja","Setiap petang","Setiap malam","Setiap pagi"],"a":"Setiap petang","pt":"D","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.b834a3","j":"mcq","s":"Mengapakah Sang Kancil mahu menyeberangi sungai?","p":["Untuk makan buah-buahan","Untuk mencari kawan","Untuk mandi","Untuk berjumpa raja"],"a":"Untuk makan buah-buahan","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.4051a5","j":"mcq","s":"Apakah yang ada di dalam sungai itu?","p":["Banyak buaya","Banyak ikan","Banyak batu","Banyak perahu"],"a":"Banyak buaya","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.07fd67","j":"mcq","s":"Bagaimanakah Sang Kancil menyeberangi sungai?","p":["Meniti jambatan","Menaiki rakit","Melompat di atas belakang buaya","Berenang"],"a":"Melompat di atas belakang buaya","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.40d312","j":"mcq","s":"Apakah sifat Sang Kancil dalam cerita ini?","p":["Malas","Penakut","Pemarah","Cerdik"],"a":"Cerdik","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.f8d64b","j":"isi","s":"Murid-murid berasa sangat ______.","bank":["sedih","seronok","marah","takut"],"a":"seronok","pt":"C","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bm-8.c0d941","j":"bs","s":"Ibu membeli buah durian.","a":"Salah","pt":"A","aras":1},{"id":"t2-bm-8.da2c06","j":"bs","s":"Gotong-royong itu diadakan pada hari Ahad.","a":"Betul","pt":"B","aras":1},{"id":"t2-bm-8.1d6354","j":"bs","s":"Penulis berkebun di hadapan rumah.","a":"Salah","pt":"D","aras":1},{"id":"t2-bm-8.cbc6a1","j":"bs","s":"Buaya-buaya beratur kerana percaya akan kata-kata Sang Kancil.","a":"Betul","pt":"E","aras":1}],"petikan":{"A":{"t":"Petikan 1 — Pasar Malam","x":"Pada malam Sabtu, Hana mengikut ibunya ke pasar malam. Di sana, ada banyak gerai. Ibu membeli sayur, ikan dan buah mangga. Hana pula membeli sebungkus apam balik. Mereka pulang ke rumah pada pukul sembilan malam."},"B":{"t":"Petikan 2 — Gotong-royong","x":"Penduduk Taman Mawar mengadakan gotong-royong pada hari Ahad. Mereka membersihkan longkang dan memotong rumput. Kanak-kanak mengutip sampah di taman permainan. Selepas itu, semua orang menikmati bubur kacang. Kawasan taman menjadi bersih dan cantik."},"C":{"t":"Petikan 3 — Lawatan ke Zoo","x":"Murid-murid Tahun 2 melawat Zoo Negara. Mereka menaiki bas sekolah. Di zoo, mereka melihat gajah, harimau dan zirafah. Cikgu Salmah menerangkan tentang makanan haiwan. Murid-murid berasa sangat seronok."},"D":{"t":"Petikan 4 — Hobi Saya","x":"Hobi saya ialah berkebun. Setiap petang, saya menyiram pokok cili dan pokok tomato di belakang rumah. Datuk mengajar saya cara membaja pokok. Apabila buahnya masak, ibu menggunakannya untuk memasak. Saya gembira kerana dapat menolong keluarga."},"E":{"t":"Petikan 5 — Sang Kancil dan Buaya","x":"Sang Kancil mahu menyeberangi sungai untuk makan buah-buahan. Di dalam sungai itu ada banyak buaya. Sang Kancil berkata bahawa raja mahu mengira jumlah buaya. Buaya-buaya pun beratur. Sang Kancil melompat di atas belakang buaya hingga sampai ke seberang."}}}]}